        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Activation: </strong><span class=\"cosmere-icon\" data-tooltip=\"Special Activation\" aria-label=\"Special Activation\">*</span></p><p><em>You adeptly move the wheels of the military machine, acquiring the supplies needed to keep your unit in fighting shape.</em></p><p>When you make a test to requisition or allocate resources, you can spend 2 focus to add an Opportunity to the result.</p><p>Additionally, when you acquire this talent, gain a utility expertise in Military Logistics.</p>",
